  "description": "Eremex.Avalonia.Controls3D adds a Graphics3D control to the Avalonia UI framework for rendering interactive 3D models. Supports simple and PBR-textured materials, perspective and isometric cameras, multiple simultaneous models, runtime rotate/pan/zoom, MVVM, and GPU rendering via the Vulkan SDK.",
